OL,3,GNEWSAWoman who 'could not run for 30
OL,4,Aseconds' completes half-Ironman
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe odds on 23-year-old Meg Stevenson
OL,7,Fcompleting a half-Ironman less than two
OL,8,Fyears after starting the NHS running
OL,9,Fprogramme Couch to 5k were stacked
OL,10,Fagainst her.
OL,12,FWhen she was aged eight, she had a
OL,13,Fkidney removed and intensive
OL,14,Fchemotherapy "reducing her lung
OL,15,Fcapacity by 70%", due to a kidney
OL,16,Fcancer diagnosis.
OL,18,FAt 19, her mother Lucy died from
OL,19,Fcancer, leaving her in charge of the
OL,20,Ffamily home and caring for her younger
OL,21,Fbrother Will.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
