OL,3,GNEWSAWoman who 'could not run for 30
OL,4,Aseconds' completes half-Ironman
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe added: "It was tricky, especially
OL,7,Fwhen I look back. I think it was harder
OL,8,Fthan I let myself realise. Starting
OL,9,Fthat and learning on my own
OL,10,Feffectively... was very tricky."
